{"id":"9bc5d5d823c2e63d","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing10-sigma-centered-poset.md","title":"ZFC Forcing10 Sigma Centered Poset","display":"df-zfc-forcing10-sigma-centered-poset — ZFC Forcing10 Sigma Centered Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-sigma-centered-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing10-sigma-centered-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing10-sigma-centered-poset — ZFC Forcing10 Sigma Centered Poset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-sigma-centered-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing10-sigma-centered-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing10-sigma-centered-poset — ZFC Forcing10 Sigma Centered Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (poset carrier)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (forcing order, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Centered}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Centered}_S\\)</span> (centered-subset predicate defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaCentered}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaCentered}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}centered\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\operatorname{Centered}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow C\\subseteq P\\land\\forall F\\in[C]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;\\forall p\\in F\\;(r\\leq_Pp)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}centered\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\operatorname{Centered}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow C\\subseteq P\\land\\forall F\\in[C]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;\\forall p\\in F\\;(r\\leq_Pp)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}centered\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\operatorname{SigmaCentered}(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\exists P_\\bullet\\in\\mathcal P(P)^\\omega\\;\\bigl(P=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}P_\\bullet(n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{Centered}_S(P_\\bullet(n),P,\\leq_P)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}centered\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\operatorname{SigmaCentered}(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\exists P_\\bullet\\in\\mathcal P(P)^\\omega\\;\\bigl(P=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}P_\\bullet(n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{Centered}_S(P_\\bullet(n),P,\\leq_P)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each countable piece is centered: every finite subset has a common stronger condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P$ (forcing order, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (poset predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}$，其中 $\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Centered}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaCentered}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}centered\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\operatorname{Centered}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow C\\subseteq P\\land\\forall F\\in[C]^{<\\omega}\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;\\forall p\\in F\\;(r\\leq_Pp)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}centered\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\operatorname{SigmaCentered}(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\exists P_\\bullet\\in\\mathcal P(P)^\\omega\\;\\bigl(P=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}P_\\bullet(n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{Centered}_S(P_\\bullet(n),P,\\leq_P)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1550,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2018","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing10-sigma-centered-poset.md|58-df-zfc-forcing10-sigma-centered-poset]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}